* Alternative package manager to npm.
* Has better caching, workspace (monorepo) support, and deterministic lockfiles (`yarn.lock`).
* `yarn add`, `yarn remove`, `yarn workspaces`, etc.

#### `-ZigBinary`:

* A flag in bun installation (`bun install --bun --yarn -ZigBinary`)
* Downloads the **Zig-built binary** version of Bun
* Often used to avoid slow builds or mismatched architectures

