#### 🔍 Key Differences: `npm install` vs `npm ci`

| Feature                | `npm install`     | `npm ci`                      |
| ---------------------- | ----------------- | ----------------------------- |
| Uses `package-lock`?   | Yes               | Yes                           |
| Updates lock file?     | Possibly          | ❌ Never                       |
| Installs from scratch? | No                | ✅ Yes (clears `node_modules`) |
| Use case               | Everyday dev work | CI/CD, reproducibility        |

> Use `npm ci` in production or CI pipelines to ensure deterministic builds.

