| Task                       | Type        | Thread            | Behavior                   |
| -------------------------- | ----------- | ----------------- | -------------------------- |
| `fs.readFile`              | I/O         | libuv thread pool | ✅ Async, won’t block       |
| `setTimeout(0)`            | Timer       | Event loop        | 🟡 Delayed due to blocking |
| `Promise.resolve().then()` | Microtask   | Event loop        | ✅ Runs before any timeout  |
| `setImmediate()`           | Check Phase | Event loop        | 🟡 Delayed if blocked      |
| `while loop` (3s)          | CPU-bound   | Main thread       | ❌ Blocks everything        |
| `crypto.pbkdf2`            | Thread pool | libuv threads     | ✅ Runs in background       |

