| Use Case          | How EventEmitter Helps                    |
| ----------------- | ----------------------------------------- |
| Chat apps         | emit messages to all sockets              |
| Logging           | emit events like `log`, `warn`, `error`   |
| File Uploading    | emit `start`, `progress`, `end`           |
| WebSockets        | trigger server-client events              |
| Custom Frameworks | emit `routeHit`, `middlewarePassed`, etc. |

