| Concept                  | Insight                                     |
| ------------------------ | ------------------------------------------- |
| `.emit`                  | Trigger all listeners for an event          |
| `.on/.once`              | Register persistent or single-use callbacks |
| `_events`                | Internal object holding all listeners       |
| `extends EventEmitter`   | Allows your classes to emit/listen          |
| `Streams, Sockets`       | All are EventEmitters                       |
| `Memory leaks`           | Occur if listener count too high            |
| `Synchronous by default` | Use `setImmediate` for async chains         |

