### 🔸 Differences: Node HTTP vs Express

| Feature          | Native Node.js              | Express.js                               |
| ---------------- | --------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |
| Routing          | Manual with `if(req.url)`   | `app.get("/path")`, regex/path params    |
| Middleware Chain | Manual (write your own)     | Built-in stack-based processing          |
| Body Parsing     | Manual stream parsing       | `express.json()`, `express.urlencoded()` |
| Readability      | Verbose                     | Clean and declarative                    |
| Performance      | Slightly better (raw speed) | Negligible difference; gains in dev time |
| Learning Curve   | Harder                      | Easier with community support            |

