## 🔹 3. Middleware in Express (Power Feature)

Middleware functions are invoked sequentially in the request-response cycle. They're the **backbone of Express architecture**.

###  Types of Middleware

| Type              | Purpose                              | Example                     |
| ----------------- | ------------------------------------ | --------------------------- |
| Application-level | Used with `app.use()` or `app.get()` | Logging, body parsing       |
| Router-level      | Same as above, scoped to router      | Route-specific logging      |
| Error-handling    | With 4 args `(err, req, res, next)`  | Centralized error handling  |
| Built-in          | Like `express.json()`                | Body parsing                |
| Third-party       | `cors`, `helmet`, etc.               | Security, compression, etc. |

