## 🔹 4. Body Parsers in Express

### ✅ Built-in `express.json()` and `express.urlencoded()`

```js
app.use(express.json()); // Parses JSON body
app.use(express.urlencoded({ extended: true })); // Parses URL-encoded form data
```

### ✅ When to use `extended: true`?

* `false`: Uses Node’s native `querystring` module (basic parsing)
* `true`: Uses the `qs` module, which can handle nested objects

```js
