## 🔹 6. Error Handling Middleware (Best Practice)

Always place **after** all routes and use 4 parameters:

```js
app.use((err, req, res, next) => {
  console.error(err.stack);
  res.status(err.status || 500).json({
    error: err.message || 'Internal Server Error',
  });
});
```

In route/controller, call `next(error)` to trigger it.

