| Model       | DB/file access, data validation             |
| Controller  | Logic — "what happens when route hits"      |
| View/Public | UI logic — either static files or templates |
| Route       | URL endpoint handlers                       |
| Middleware  | Bridge logic (auth, logging, validation)    |

